        "stage": 15,
        "statement": "Major flooding reaches lowest homes near the FM 1826 gauge. The FM 1826 crossing is under six feet of water, and many secondary roads and bridges near the creek from the headwaters to the Onion Creek confluence are very dangerous to motorists."
